{"municipality_code":"01211","pref":"北海道","city":"網走市","headline":"貴重な土木遺産があります。","display_comment_enriched":"網走市では、網走村、北見町、勇仁村などの歴史地名を手がかりに、土地の成り立ちをたどれます。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚にまつわる場所が点在し、「桂ヶ岡チヤシ跡」、「二ッ岩遺跡」、「大曲洞窟遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板、網走村、北見町に関わる地名碑や地域の歴史案内板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では林好次や米村喜男衛に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「道東観光開発」や「網走流氷観光砕氷船」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":203,"rank":396,"percentile":79.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":57,"rank":343,"percentile":81.5,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":30,"rank":852,"percentile":53.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":21,"rank":296,"percentile":83.0,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":4,"rank":882,"percentile":46.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":5,"rank":804,"percentile":50.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":2,"rank":33,"percentile":94.7,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["林好次","米村喜男衛","中川